        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/6decb8068b71a37b3003365c0f2f643b.avif?t=1761712725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras_big/6decb8068b71a37b3003365c0f2f643b.avif?t=1761712725 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS DESIGNED TO BE COMPLETED IN 1 - 1.5 HOURS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS HAS NO LINES HISTORY SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS HAS NO CHARACTER CGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE FOR DEMO PLAYERS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay mechanics are completely different from the demo, most of them were cut and some were altered. Please continue reading below to see gameplay mechanics in the current version of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase Fox's sixth game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth Universally Acknowledged is a short, high school, slice of life, dating sim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the daily life of a high school student named Talay. Depending on choices you made, Talay could ended up with one of the four love interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice of life, Romantic Comedy, Magical Realism, Dating Sim, Visual Novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art, Music &amp; Sound Design</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Love Interests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/f8364ab3487c41c1d42d055fe64011cb.avif?t=1761712725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras_big/f8364ab3487c41c1d42d055fe64011cb.avif?t=1761712725 width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Miy</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talay's cheerful best friend with cooking skills that are quite extraordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/d5a252128d31b9e74ffa38c021679ae4.avif?t=1761712725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras_big/d5a252128d31b9e74ffa38c021679ae4.avif?t=1761712725 width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Courtney</i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious boy who always sits in the same spot every time Talay visits the library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/c3026a95b796d461c60f3f422af31a09.avif?t=1761712725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras_big/c3026a95b796d461c60f3f422af31a09.avif?t=1761712725 width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Kit</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talay's best friend. He is shy and quiet but cares greatly about Talay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/c88535c67605c05d5e7090f673ef6548.avif?t=1761712725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras_big/c88535c67605c05d5e7090f673ef6548.avif?t=1761712725 width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>August</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An annoyingly charming celebrity that Talay, who will never admit it to anybody, really loves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Making</strong><br>In this game, you make choices by picking Talay's expressions. The story will be shaped based on what you pick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/ae644503712077915788d382848d16ba.avif?t=1761712725\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Flowchart</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flowchart allows the you to enter the story at specific points and access every story branch easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/350bf5cbb29e83b52c9bb8ceaada7cb3.avif?t=1761712725\" width=1200 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has multiple endings.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/6f96b31904e67f8aab4ebb59e8917f22.avif?t=1761712725\" width=400 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------- <br> <br>Story, Art, Music and Sound Design <br>by ChaseFOX <br> <br>Proofread<br>by Eskay <br> <br>---------------------------------</p></li></ul>",
